<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan forces have forced Haftar militia members to surrender at a key airbase while the Libyan army continues shelling Haftar posts. Turkish officials have welcomed a motion supporting Libyan troops, and the Atlantic Council has urged fixing Libya’s budget to enable reunification and democracy. The United Nations reported new laws criminalising child conscription and raising the recruitment age to 18. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, and China is returning to Libya with military forces linked to recent business deals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQYnlmemh2ZDVCTU5jSENPS3Z5UFAxc2NxVW4weVpldFJMVnpFbzMxYjlIWjItRHBaSzU2eW1Dd3YwM041eTdJVjQ2YTVpd3p4X3RFV2xiYVZZVEFsODB3T0xNVm4xZ2s3QWJDWHVSMmxqMmIwSl8wdUhBOG0yNWhSLWpEN3BjWWNHRDYwNnVPa3Ezb0hGVmZEM3dTQXg3THNLcWRwaWRqLXNEQXJhekltZ3h4MzZtUU1QeWNjbU5B?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQTV9QUExHNVRIdWFBRW5nd2I4TGRrODMyR2lCbmFld0tsb0UwUEt0SnhhUHZvUDJzZURJQ0NtUHh4S0doVkVCT195RElXcEdCcjg2RmQ1LTYwODY2OTJYY0tadXdKdzFKQWhUX213Yk9Iem9Xd0JSOV94elEwb0Y0RVliZFhnMTFYbnFjNXhpcGNPcnNEaGxuMDF3Y0JsU2RkS3FSbldlbnpzSTNNSjlMQUdaRFNYM1AtV20wQ09SU2R5MzFZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Il Sole 24 ORE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQT0htekJfMHdHS2ItYmRCQXdBNmdjUG1ISUxoMkx6Ym9BTW5EaE84ckRrU1JXamlNSUJ5dVZXUEdjajNTQWdaRWJ2WlhRNUZPLVQ4emwxVGpnNkl2Mll4RURVeEsxQ3RyRkQ5cFBGTnU0Vnp0NWw1dGtmTERIQnA1WmNiandwbFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chatham House&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTFBlbF9hUENBSmJ3NUF1a2x1X0I2U1BybkFaN3Z5RjZqY1FtTmpJX3F6RmhkRUhXV3VFdW9qZ1R0anJlelg4MS1ZQUlGR2JMRElkVzFz?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Atalayar&lt;/a&gt;, 